s</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 1.34, p.21, DjVu scan 36"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> 为有限词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(S)\">\\(g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(S)\\)</span>，其显式编码条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" href=\"?note=a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" title=\"29-df-godel-numbering\">29-df-godel-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d91cca50bc997dfa\" href=\"?note=d91cca50bc997dfa\" title=\"29-df-tm-computes\">29-df-tm-computes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi\">\\(\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi\\)</span> 使用任意非空模型的后承。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P\">\\(\\chi_P\\)</span> 为下式的全特征函数。内部定理 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7f92cb4acad3757e\" href=\"?note=7f92cb4acad3757e\" title=\"29-thm-completeness\">29-thm-completeness</a> 的空前提实例提供该检查关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P(p,q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;(p,q)\\in P,\\\\0,&amp;(p,q)\\notin P.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_P(p,q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;(p,q)\\in P,\\\\0,&amp;(p,q)\\notin P.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_2\\quad\\left(\\operatorname{Computes}(M,\\chi_P)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p,g(\\varphi))\\in P)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_2\\quad\\left(\\operatorname{Computes}(M,\\chi_P)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p,g(\\varphi))\\in P)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原 Theorem 1.34 对一阶有效式的可判定证明检查关系存在性。原第57本书外部链接已由本书内的强完备性条目替代；这里从该条取空前提列表代码。未对未指定的演算规则宣称完备，也不将书目定位等同于机器形式化证明。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"deaf0e86bfe2a066","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tm-computes","status":"resolved","id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tm-computes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ 为有限词汇；$g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(S)$，其显式编码条件见 [[29-df-godel-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tm-computes","status":"resolved","id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}_2$ 与 $\\operatorname{Computes}$ 取 [[29-df-tm-computes]]；$\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi$ 使用任意非空模型的后承。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$，$p,q\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\chi_P$ 为下式的全特征函数。内部定理 [[29-thm-completeness]] 的空前提实例提供该检查关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\operatorname{EffSentCode}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computes}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P(p,q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&(p,q)\\in P,\\\\0,&(p,q)\\notin P.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_2\\quad\\left(\\operatorname{Computes}(M,\\chi_P)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\varnothing\\models_S\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p,g(\\varphi))\\in P)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2132,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-completeness]]、[[29-thm-fo-compactness]] — 完备性与紧致性"},{"id":"cb6c4f5943f5740e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地通用句子演算定义。规则与公理是显式外部参数，ProofSeq由有限逐步条件定义，不再把未分型的ProofSeq/last名字当成完整证明论。原书Theorem1.34的递归公理化存在性另由 [[29-thm-fo-completeness]] 陈述；本条没有指定标准一阶演算，也不能独立推出其可靠性、完备性或证明检查可判定性。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-fo-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","deaf0e86bfe2a066","711217f22972ffc0","d91cca50bc997dfa","7f92cb4acad3757e"]}